      "title": "Netanyahu accuses NYC Mayor Mamdani of 'fomenting hate' after arrest threat",
      "link": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c5yegvd9ddeo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
      "description": "Mamdani walked back his threat last week, acknowledging he lacked the legal power to arrest Netanyahu on a warrant issued by the International Criminal Court.",
